{"server":"cn","storyId":"act9d0_level_act9d0_03_beg","groupId":"act9d0","stageId":"act9d0_03","title":"挤压","storyCode":"DM-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b1bd90ea9d3ea4efca1a5d94dd4028255dafd50891a107951ba355265016d407","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"那些萨卡兹都停下了。\n燃烧着的废墟向中心挤压过来，那些怪物一样的敌人居高临下。\n在这场包围中心的，是一个突兀出现的女性，一个......古怪的人。\n她不是萨卡兹，但是就那么只身站在战场的正中心，面不改色。\n伊内丝在颤抖，我可猜不出她是为了什么颤抖。\n听力似乎因为爆炸稍有受损，我听不清他们在说什么。\n但是我知道，他们在畏惧。\n是因为面前这个人吗？\n不是，所有人都看着另一个方向，都看着另一个人。\n在我失去意识的最后一秒，我看到了——\n一个......萨卡兹。\n毫无敌意的......纤细的萨卡兹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们......临时......\n萨卡兹......必须......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......你要......什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的伤很重......如果我们不在这里作应急处理......\n......如果......他......会找到这里......我们没有时间......\n......凯尔希，来搭把手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......唉，好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"船上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"船......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们怎么还活着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你想自嘲能不能不要带上我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"总的来说，被救下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......那这里是哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"运输队本队，我们一直护送的就是这艘舰船，现在临时收纳了一些伤员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"看样子都是些正在搭建中的设施，真是不明白这艘船是什么构造，闻所未闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是那时候看见的影子，确实是......还是别深究了吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫德雷呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......他在和雇主......不，他在和......和这里的主人谈判。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"也对，既然你还愿意乖乖待在这里，那赫德雷肯定没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，这里的主人是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像很紧张，我不需要你那种有害视力的源石技艺就能感觉到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不会以为，我待在这里真的是在关心你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我想也不是，那是为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在，稍微有点可怜他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"那间屋子里的，都是些什么妖魔鬼怪......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不用这么紧张，会影响到会议的效率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"你们尽力做到了最好，而泄露了情报是我们的失误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......战场上无论对错，我很清楚我们在和谁作对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"可我没想到那位指挥官......原来真的是殿下身边的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"您的......那种力量也让我深感意外，我还没有为您出手相助正式道谢，凯尔希医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"谢特蕾西娅吧，是她的意思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"这里不是卡兹戴尔，不必多礼，我们坐下谈吧，赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......遵命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"那您身边的这位就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你不要介意，任何战略情报博士都必须了如指掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢理解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（真的是一艘舰船......这个规模不算小了吧......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（有些设施看上去是全新的，有些地方又破旧的让人无法靠近......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（我记得......这是从雷姆必拓......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娇小的卡特斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！抱、抱歉，这前面的设施还在施工......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娇小的卡特斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生说过......不要随便去更深处的地方，会很危险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哼嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我就换条路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娇小的卡特斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......真有礼貌啊，那双耳朵，果然不是萨卡兹吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，那个比伊内丝还讨人厌的女人，好像是个医生来着？也不是萨卡兹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"这里到底是怎么回事，明明身在战场的中心，尽是些萨卡兹之外的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"怎么又卡住了啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"冷、冷静点，可露希尔，不过是今天的第七次短路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"第——七——次——短——路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"这对天才工程师来说是莫大的耻辱！要不要考虑重新买一批门！那样比较快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"诶......因为多出了许多伤员，他们的伙食也需要紧急采购，人手和预算方面都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你就这么放弃，难道就不算耻辱了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"咕呜呜呜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"那么！殿下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"给我三天时间，三天！既然怎么都修不好，干脆把整个安保控制系统拆了重装！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"重、重装？可行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道是谁造了这些不明所以的系统还埋在雷姆必拓地下深处，但既然弄不明白——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"——就把它替换成可以弄明白的！非常简单的道理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......那，就交给你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"得令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......还要很久才能投入使用吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......我记得是和赫德雷一起的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了吗？你之前伤的很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（她刚才那算是被吓到了吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"佣兵W，我在找赫德雷队长，然后不小心迷路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"侦查的时候要留神点，有些区域还在施工，电缆都裸露在外，小心触电。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这种程度的谨慎应该也算是你们雇佣兵的天性了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"W，是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我特蕾西娅吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷在会议结束后和博士聊了两句，现在应该已经回到临时病房了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不要让同伴太担心，你也回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西娅......殿下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，这里不是卡兹戴尔，不必拘谨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那特蕾西娅......殿下为什么要在这儿和一堵门较劲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才那个小个子是个工程师吧，这点小事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"这也不是件小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"是......吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少事是真的不值得去关注的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......那罗德岛是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你听见了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"是这艘船的名字，虽然还没有正式的命名仪式，我......想这么称呼它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一厢情愿而已，说不定博士和凯尔希会反对用它的“本名”呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，本名？这艘船的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你也看见了，这艘船并非卡兹戴尔所制造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"在最深处，尚且残留下的资料里，我翻阅到了这个名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"“罗德岛”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道这到底意味着什么，嗯......凯尔希应该懂得多一些吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想这么命名它。既然它已经有了名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（和篡夺卡兹戴尔的摄政王分庭抗礼......几乎凭一己之力重新统合了大半萨卡兹门阀的特蕾西娅殿下......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（正在亲自修复一扇断了电的自动门？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么了？表情有点奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"在殿下面前笑出声来......算不算僭越？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不算吧......不过凯尔希和博士都是不苟言笑的......战士们背负着很多，也不太容易敞开心扉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的话，我倒希望你们都可以展露笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"但这是一种不负责任的奢望，我不能忽视压在大家身上的重担。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那我笑一会应该没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，请？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这样我突然笑不出来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"总觉得是我的错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......咳，不敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我是特蕾西娅，它是罗德岛，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"“W”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说那个，“W”只代表一个雇佣兵。你的名字才能代表你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不要让这种沾满战火气息的伪装持续太久，不光是说名字，就算是我多管闲事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有自己的名字吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"对在卡兹戴尔出生的萨卡兹来说，这是件稀松平常的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"很少有萨卡兹会这么在意......名字。被遗忘的速度太快，花力气去记住那么多人的本名是很没效率的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想忘记他们，也不能忘记他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"如果等到卡兹戴尔的命运尘埃落定......等到你不再是“W”，而我们还有机会这样交谈的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定你可以拥有一个更好的名字，更适合你这样的萨卡兹女性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"就像罗德岛一样，如果有个名字的话，听上去就温暖多了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想过这种......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅，通讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔有动作，博士已经在着手布置了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我马上就去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"W？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗯，我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还愿意为我们而战，无论你那时在做什么，这里都随时欢迎你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会对特蕾西娅的决定指手画脚，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"不要以为你会在这里大受欢迎，我看过你的全部履历，你很危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，彼此彼此？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的身体恢复得很快，但还远远没到可以随意闲逛的程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"回到你的病榻上去，否则会有人把你扛回去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"事后我才意识到。\n我从头到尾，都没敢正视特蕾西娅的眼睛。\n为什么呢。\n她看上去明明那么天真。\n根本不像是主持了这场残酷战争的领袖之一......\n天真......吗？\n但天真的人可不会有那种眼神......那种......悲伤的......\n......她的身边似乎总是环绕着那两个人。\n如果......我能和他们站在一起......\n我会看见什么样的风景呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（那个兜帽......是他们嘴里的“博士”？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（是不是看向这边了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么回事......为什么......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（我在害怕？怕什么？他给人的感觉就是普通的......不，太模糊了，我没见过这样诡异的人......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊......巴别塔的战地指挥官，我好像想起来了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（“博士”，是吗。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我开始明白伊内丝为什么不敢靠近殿下了。\n也许我也该担忧一下，才是对自己好吧。\n但是......不知道为什么，啊，对于特蕾西娅的事情，我好像总是不知道为什么......\n就当是心血来潮吧，赫德雷他们会理解的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
